#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HARDNESS_NONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HARDNESS_NONE"
msgid "{0} · no hardness requirement, no wear (HP {1})"
msgstr "建造材料：{0}\n生命值：{1}\n这个建筑没有硬度要求，不会产生机械磨损。"

#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HARDNESS_OK
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HARDNESS_OK"
msgid "{0} · hardness {1}/{2} · no mechanical wear (HP {3})"
msgstr "建造材料：{0} · 硬度：{1}（要求：{2}）\n生命值：{3}\n材料硬度足够，不会产生机械磨损。"

#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HARDNESS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HARDNESS_WEAK"
msgid "{0} · hardness {1}/{2} short, wears with production time (HP {3}, {4} wear/production second, {5} HP/wear unit)"
msgstr "建造材料：{0} · 硬度：{1}（要求：{2}）\n生命值：{3}\n机械磨损：{4}单位/工作秒，每单位损失{5}生命值。"

