#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.NO_TASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.NO_TASK"
