#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.PREHEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.PREHEAT"
msgid "Preheating"
