#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.TOPUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.TOPUP"
msgid "Top-up heating"
