msgctxt "STRINGS.MODOPTIONS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.WARNING"
msgid "Turning a system off in an existing save drops the data it keeps on buildings the next time you save; added rooms fall back to vanilla rooms and related duplicant effects and traits stop working. Back up your save first."
msgstr "在已有存档中途关闭某个系统：该系统记在建筑上的数据（工业订单与磨损进度、建筑活化度、航天飞行加成等）会在下次存档时丢失；新增房间退回原版房间，复制人身上相关的效果和特质暂时失效。重新开启后系统从头开始计算。建议先备份存档。"

